{"4364880":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"键盘农场 Keyboard Farm","steam_appid":4364880,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5281340],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for playing our Demo! Enjoying your little farm? Add Keyboard Farm to your wishlist and stay tuned for news about the full release.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Keyboard Farm<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buddy, you can farm just by tapping your keyboard!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From today on, be a happy coder: type, grow crops, and harvest to your heart's content.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's right, your keyboard is a little farm! Keep it on your desktop and watch greenery quietly grow across your keyboard while you focus on work.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new Demo brings more tiles, an all-new buff system, and special buildings. Come see what's new on your farm!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b4ac6387552b97d9ef4b50ddaebd2234.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b4ac6387552b97d9ef4b50ddaebd2234.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b4ac6387552b97d9ef4b50ddaebd2234.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tap the Keyboard to Grow Crops<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow, sow, and water. No keystroke goes to waste! Place your farm on your desktop and get on with your usual work. Every keystroke helps your plants grow, and harvesting mature crops earns you coins.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/58aad425520c9784a082f7e2f683c942.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/58aad425520c9784a082f7e2f683c942.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/58aad425520c9784a082f7e2f683c942.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Tiles, More Plants<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new desert tile joins the farm! Pond and woodland tiles have also become more fertile, allowing you to grow a wider variety of plants. Unlock different tiles and collect all kinds of crops to make your keyboard farm flourish!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b91556d416de6f1f82f7ff91fc3f632a.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b91556d416de6f1f82f7ff91fc3f632a.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b91556d416de6f1f82f7ff91fc3f632a.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Your Keycaps Work Together!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy special keycaps from the shop to give nearby crops a boost!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your layout to get the most out of every tile, or arrange everything your way and enjoy a relaxing farming break.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/7790194cfdff5c2bb5d324a3f99b7455.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/7790194cfdff5c2bb5d324a3f99b7455.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/7790194cfdff5c2bb5d324a3f99b7455.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn Something While You Farm?<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a school on your farm to unlock an exciting mini-game: vocabulary practice!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, wasn't I supposed to be slacking off in Keyboard Farm? Why am I studying in a game, too?!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/4c3e7ff3f4533a9448f5ed4e6c02b841.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/4c3e7ff3f4533a9448f5ed4e6c02b841.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/4c3e7ff3f4533a9448f5ed4e6c02b841.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Mode: A Tiny Farm on Your Desktop<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to the all-new Mini Mode with a single click! Your farm shrinks down to a more compact size, keeping you company on your desktop.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/f4f79cd0f3e392fca72e17e44747666b.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/f4f79cd0f3e392fca72e17e44747666b.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/f4f79cd0f3e392fca72e17e44747666b.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Keyboard Farm<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned coins on a variety of keycaps, unlock different tile and plant styles, and arrange your farm just the way you like. Give every keycap its place and turn your ordinary keyboard into a one-of-a-kind little world!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/cc94cd224b4420bb496b39e551ca64c8.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/cc94cd224b4420bb496b39e551ca64c8.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/cc94cd224b4420bb496b39e551ca64c8.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Track Your Typing Habits<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wonder how many times you press your keyboard each day?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Farm tracks how often each key is pressed and generates a personal keyboard usage report.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/0aa1b70578b2ca4cd32bd121bcb75f61.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/0aa1b70578b2ca4cd32bd121bcb75f61.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/0aa1b70578b2ca4cd32bd121bcb75f61.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Demo, with Plenty of Improvements<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've made a whole host of improvements, from visuals and controls to UI layout and stability. There are more improvements than carrots fresh out of the ground!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to our Playtest veterans, and welcome to everyone joining us for the first time! Whether you love planning your farm, collecting plants, or simply adding a little greenery to your busy desktop, there's a little corner of the world here just for you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/9a45676a40a748fa1acc98e2188b88ab.avif?t=1793157942\" width=1196 height=634 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/033b3c8bdb3a87b63a500c7309887006.avif?t=1793157942\" width=1152 height=602 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Privacy Matters<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We take your privacy seriously. Here's our promise:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game only tracks keystroke frequency, meaning how often each key is pressed. It never records the actual text you type.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can run entirely offline.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All statistics are stored locally on your device and are never uploaded to external servers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type with peace of mind and enjoy your farming life!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for playing our Demo! Enjoying your little farm? Add Keyboard Farm to your wishlist and stay tuned for news about the full release.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Keyboard Farm<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buddy, you can farm just by tapping your keyboard!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From today on, be a happy coder: type, grow crops, and harvest to your heart's content.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's right, your keyboard is a little farm! Keep it on your desktop and watch greenery quietly grow across your keyboard while you focus on work.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new Demo brings more tiles, an all-new buff system, and special buildings. Come see what's new on your farm!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b4ac6387552b97d9ef4b50ddaebd2234.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b4ac6387552b97d9ef4b50ddaebd2234.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b4ac6387552b97d9ef4b50ddaebd2234.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tap the Keyboard to Grow Crops<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow, sow, and water. No keystroke goes to waste! Place your farm on your desktop and get on with your usual work. Every keystroke helps your plants grow, and harvesting mature crops earns you coins.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/58aad425520c9784a082f7e2f683c942.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/58aad425520c9784a082f7e2f683c942.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/58aad425520c9784a082f7e2f683c942.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Tiles, More Plants<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new desert tile joins the farm! Pond and woodland tiles have also become more fertile, allowing you to grow a wider variety of plants. Unlock different tiles and collect all kinds of crops to make your keyboard farm flourish!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b91556d416de6f1f82f7ff91fc3f632a.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b91556d416de6f1f82f7ff91fc3f632a.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/b91556d416de6f1f82f7ff91fc3f632a.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Your Keycaps Work Together!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy special keycaps from the shop to give nearby crops a boost!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your layout to get the most out of every tile, or arrange everything your way and enjoy a relaxing farming break.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/7790194cfdff5c2bb5d324a3f99b7455.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/7790194cfdff5c2bb5d324a3f99b7455.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/7790194cfdff5c2bb5d324a3f99b7455.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn Something While You Farm?<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a school on your farm to unlock an exciting mini-game: vocabulary practice!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, wasn't I supposed to be slacking off in Keyboard Farm? Why am I studying in a game, too?!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/4c3e7ff3f4533a9448f5ed4e6c02b841.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/4c3e7ff3f4533a9448f5ed4e6c02b841.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/4c3e7ff3f4533a9448f5ed4e6c02b841.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Mode: A Tiny Farm on Your Desktop<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to the all-new Mini Mode with a single click! Your farm shrinks down to a more compact size, keeping you company on your desktop.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/f4f79cd0f3e392fca72e17e44747666b.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/f4f79cd0f3e392fca72e17e44747666b.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/f4f79cd0f3e392fca72e17e44747666b.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Keyboard Farm<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned coins on a variety of keycaps, unlock different tile and plant styles, and arrange your farm just the way you like. Give every keycap its place and turn your ordinary keyboard into a one-of-a-kind little world!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/cc94cd224b4420bb496b39e551ca64c8.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/cc94cd224b4420bb496b39e551ca64c8.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/cc94cd224b4420bb496b39e551ca64c8.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Track Your Typing Habits<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wonder how many times you press your keyboard each day?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Farm tracks how often each key is pressed and generates a personal keyboard usage report.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/0aa1b70578b2ca4cd32bd121bcb75f61.poster.avif?t=1793157942\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/0aa1b70578b2ca4cd32bd121bcb75f61.webm?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/0aa1b70578b2ca4cd32bd121bcb75f61.mp4?t=1793157942\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Demo, with Plenty of Improvements<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've made a whole host of improvements, from visuals and controls to UI layout and stability. There are more improvements than carrots fresh out of the ground!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to our Playtest veterans, and welcome to everyone joining us for the first time! Whether you love planning your farm, collecting plants, or simply adding a little greenery to your busy desktop, there's a little corner of the world here just for you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/9a45676a40a748fa1acc98e2188b88ab.avif?t=1793157942\" width=1196 height=634 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/extras\/033b3c8bdb3a87b63a500c7309887006.avif?t=1793157942\" width=1152 height=602 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Privacy Matters<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We take your privacy seriously. Here's our promise:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game only tracks keystroke frequency, meaning how often each key is pressed. It never records the actual text you type.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can run entirely offline.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All statistics are stored locally on your device and are never uploaded to external servers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type with peace of mind and enjoy your farming life!<\/p>","short_description":"&quot;Keyboard Farm&quot; is a desktop idle farming game. Place it on your desktop and focus on your work. Every key is a plot of land—each keystroke helps plants grow. Harvest crops to collect coins, unlock various keycaps, and create your own keyboard world.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/730e67d40dc0730f15bbf4f7d159d50b4f9613f9\/header.jpg?t=1793157942","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/dfcf7d0e8c482ed38dd0a845817f701292f7e1f4\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793157942","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4364880\/dfcf7d0e8c482ed38dd0a845817f701292f7e1f4\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793157942","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 (64bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ i3 @ 3.2 GHZ<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Graphics card with DX11<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 (64bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ i5 @ 4.4 GHZ<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated Graphics card with DX11<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 11.0+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ i3 or Apple M1 chip<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 11.0+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ i5 or Apple M2 chip<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"}}}}